    </div>
    <div class="lg:pt-6">
      <h2 class="page-display mb-6 mt-0 text-3xl sm:text-5xl">Then you fall.</h2>
      <p class="page-prose mb-0">Past ten metres the water starts pulling you down. You stop kicking and sink on your own. The depth washes out everything you do not need.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

